0..76 Comment "//! Two protocols that differ only in how their messages are encoded are one"
77..151 Comment "//! type, once each pair of payload types that differ is paid with a path:"
152..228 Comment "//! bisimilarity up to an equivalence of the payloads, the paths the session"
229..280 Comment "//! certificate carries to the kernel. Gay and Hole"
281..355 Comment "//! [Gay-2005-subtyping_session_types_pi_calculus] relate payloads by type"
356..422 Comment "//! equality; the path generalises the equality to an equivalence."
